Source: Wikipedia — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Go-Suzaku$b$, 'en', $b$https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Emperor%20Go-Suzaku.jpg?width=640$b$, $b$Ruler$b$, $b$Tsuchimikado-dono$b$, $b$Higashi Sanjō-dono$b$, 'day', 'day');
